EVALUATION.md §11.1, DECISIONS 249, 263: E1903 variantCase at the name of each case that declares an input field, naming it Variant.case; a case without one, and a record that holds its input alone, are not reported.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local variant Source {
  env {
    key: input String? from env "KEY"
  }
  file {
    path: input String? from env "PATH_ARG"
    name: String
  }
  fixed {
    key: String
  }
}

/// The config.
let src: Source = fixed { key: "k" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E1903]  a/a.canon:4:3
  variant case Source.env declares an input field: input fields are allowed only in records

error[E1903]  a/a.canon:7:3
  variant case Source.file declares an input field: input fields are allowed only in records

2 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
